WEBVTT

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:31.315
die stoere man.

00:08:31.315 --> 00:08:32.900
Groene, trieste ogen,

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:34.728
in de donkere patronen van het gras,

00:08:34.728 --> 00:08:36.245
gaan ervandoor.

00:08:36.245 --> 00:08:37.970
De flinke sterren,

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:40.657
lichte helmen en puntige sporen,

00:08:40.657 --> 00:08:42.047
gaan ervandoor.

00:08:42.047 --> 00:08:43.402
Mijn angsten in bed,

00:08:43.402 --> 00:08:45.880
angsten van leven
en angsten van dood,

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.360
gaan ervandoor.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.656
Die stoere man komt op,

00:08:49.656 --> 00:08:52.576
van beneden en loopt zonder gefilosofeer,

00:08:52.576 --> 00:08:54.353
die stoere man."

00:08:54.353 --> 00:08:57.343
[Wallace Stevens]

00:08:57.343 --> 00:09:02.176
De zon in dit gedicht
van Wallace Stevens lijkt zo serieus,